# 5. Abstract

**EduGenie – Google Gemini Powered Learning Assistant** is an AI-based educational application designed to provide students with personalized and interactive learning support.

Traditional educational systems often provide standardized learning content, while students have different learning abilities, knowledge levels, and study requirements. EduGenie addresses this problem by integrating Google Gemini's generative AI capabilities into an educational workflow.

The system allows students to ask academic questions, receive explanations at different difficulty levels, summarize learning materials, generate quizzes, evaluate practice performance, create study plans, and receive learning recommendations. The platform is designed around the learning cycle **Learn → Practice → Evaluate → Improve**.

The application uses a frontend interface, backend services, database storage, authentication, and Gemini API integration. The backend manages application logic and securely communicates with Gemini, while the database maintains relevant user and learning information.

The project demonstrates how generative AI can be integrated into an educational application to provide interactive and personalized learning assistance while considering security, privacy, reliability, and responsible use of AI.

**Keywords:** Artificial Intelligence, Google Gemini, Generative AI, Learning Assistant, Personalized Learning, Educational Technology, AI Tutor.

