# 18. Limitations

The project has several limitations.

### 1. AI Accuracy

Generative AI may occasionally produce incorrect or incomplete information.

### 2. Internet Dependency

The application depends on network connectivity and availability of external services.

### 3. API Dependency

The AI functionality depends on the availability, limits, and applicable terms of the Gemini service.

### 4. Limited Personalization

The initial version may have limited learning history and therefore cannot represent a student's learning needs perfectly.

### 5. AI Evaluation

Automated evaluation of subjective answers may not always match expert human assessment.

### 6. Privacy

Student data and learning materials require appropriate handling and protection.

