**EduGenie – Google Gemini Powered Learning Assistant** demonstrates the integration of generative AI into an educational application.

The project combines an AI Tutor, personalized explanations, study-material assistance, quiz generation, study planning, and progress tracking within a single platform.

The core concept is:

> **Learn → Practice → Evaluate → Improve**

Google Gemini provides the generative-AI capabilities, while the EduGenie application provides the educational workflow, user interface, personalization logic, data management, and learning experience.

The project provides a foundation for future development in **adaptive learning, multimodal education, voice-based tutoring, multilingual learning, and teacher-assisted educational systems**.

